					<description><![CDATA[<h2 data-pm-slice="1 1 []">Iron Turkey 3D Challenge &#38; Honor Our Military Shoot</h2>
<p><strong>Sunday, October 4, 2026</strong><br />
<strong>Rube Powell Balboa Park Archery Range</strong></p>
<p>Join San Diego Archers for the <strong>Iron Turkey 3D Challenge</strong>, featuring a full 3D course and several specialty shots, including the Iron Turkey.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><a href="https://forms.gle/Z3PYZJ4HoKLuPHj57">Register and Pay Now</a> </span></p>
<h3>Shoot Details</h3>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li><strong>34 3D targets</strong></li>
<li><strong>1 arrow per target</strong></li>
<li><strong>Maximum score: 355</strong></li>
<li><strong>Rangefinders allowed</strong></li>
<li>Specialty shots include the <strong>Iron Turkey, Blind Shot, Jakes, and Distant Gobbler</strong></li>
</ul>
<h3>Iron Turkey Scoring</h3>
<h3 class="p8"><span class="s1"><img fetchpriority="high" decoding="async" class="alignright size-medium wp-image-1004" src="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/ironturkey2-300x214.jpg" alt="ironturkey2" width="300" height="214" srcset="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/ironturkey2-300x214.jpg 300w, https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/ironturkey2.jpg 380w" sizes="(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px" /></span></h3>
<p>The <strong>Iron Turkey</strong> features two scoring dots:</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li><strong>Large dot: 20 points</strong></li>
<li><strong>Small dot: 25 points</strong></li>
</ul>
<p>An <strong>alternate target with standard 3D scoring</strong> will also be available for archers who prefer not to shoot the Iron Turkey.</p>
<h3>Honor Our Military</h3>
<p><strong>Active-duty and retired U.S. military shoot FREE with military ID.</strong></p>
<h3>Schedule</h3>
<p><strong>Check-in:</strong> 7:45–8:30 AM<br />
<strong>Range briefing:</strong> After 8:30 AM<br />
<strong>Shooting begins:</strong> 9:00 AM</p>
<p>Please check in at the visitors&#8217; table, complete your waiver, and pick up your scorecard before entering the practice area.</p>
<h3>Traditional &#38; Youth Stakes</h3>
<p>Traditional and youth stakes will be available on longer targets.</p>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li><strong>Youth (ages 12–14):</strong> Maximum distance 40 yards</li>
<li><strong>Cubs (11 and under):</strong> Maximum distance 25 yards</li>
<li><strong>Traditional:</strong> Maximum distance 40 yards</li>
</ul>
<h3>Registration</h3>
<ul data-spread="false">
<li><strong>Children 14 and under:</strong> FREE</li>
<li><strong>SDA Members:</strong> $10</li>
<li><strong>Non-Members:</strong> $15</li>
<li><strong>Active-Duty &#38; Retired Military:</strong> FREE with ID</li>
</ul>
<p>Optional <strong>Mulligans and Doe Tags</strong> are available.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><strong><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><a href="https://forms.gle/Z3PYZJ4HoKLuPHj57">Register and Pay Now</a> </span>.</strong></p>
<h3>Volunteers Needed</h3>
<p>Volunteers are needed beginning at <strong>6:15 AM</strong> to help set up targets. Help is also needed after the shoot to take down and store targets.</p>
<h3>Concessions</h3>
<p>Water is available at the visitors&#8217; table. Sodas and snacks are available for $1.</p>
<h2>San Diego Archers</h2>
<p>Come out for one of SDA&#8217;s most unique 3D shoots of the year and take your shot at the <strong>Iron Turkey</strong>.</p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p><span style="font-size: 18pt;"><a href="https://forms.gle/Z3PYZJ4HoKLuPHj57">Register and Pay Now</a> </span></p>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com/iron-turkey-3d-challenge-honor-our-military-shoot-october-4-2026/">Iron Turkey 3D Challenge &#038; Honor Our Military Shoot &#8211; October 4, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com">San Diego Archers</a>.</p>
]]></description>
