		<title>Morley Field Flat-Ground 3D  – September 12, 2026</title>
		<link>https://sandiegoarchers.com/morley-field-flat-ground-3d-september-12-2026/</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[archer2]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 17:58:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Events]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[KeyEvents]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[San Diego Archers 3D Round]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://sandiegoarchers.com/?p=30471</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<h3 style="color: #993300;"><span style="color: #333333;">A</span> <span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #993300;">Flat-Ground 3D Shoot</span> will be hosted by the San Diego Archers on</span> Saturday, September 12th, 2026, <span style="color: #000000;">at the Morley Field Sports Complex Archery Range (</span><a href="https://www.accuweather.com/en/us/balboa-park/92101/daily-weather-forecast/2628152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🌧️ AccuWeather</a><span style="color: #000000;">)</span></h3>
<h3><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw x1bwycvy x193iq5w x4fas0m x19kjcj4 alignright" src="https://scontent.fsan1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/559007392_10161975462198193_9075367682779313500_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_tt6&#38;cstp=mx2048x1536&#38;ctp=s2048x1536&#38;_nc_cat=102&#38;_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&#38;ccb=1-7&#38;_nc_sid=127cfc&#38;_nc_ohc=A46ZBWP7r3kQ7kNvwHoQ-A-&#38;[long]&#38;_nc_zt=23&#38;_nc_ht=scontent.fsan1-2.fna&#38;_nc_gid=eF4ln9lFqaEPFUEwhE8kIA&#38;_nc_ss=7b2a8&#38;[long]&#38;oe=6AA232DA" alt="No photo description available." width="533" height="400" data-visualcompletion="media-vc-image" /></h3>
<p><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">• Tournament preregistration and pay online today</span></a></p>
<h3>This event will be a Flatground 3D shoot held at the <b>Morley Field Archery Range </b>at <b>3pm</b>. Check in/Equipment Check will open at 2:30pm, and archers are encouraged to show up as early as 2pm to help set up. Walk on registrations are allowed!</h3>
<h3>There will be 2 rounds of 10 3D target stations and an iron-ring challenge placed at <b>unmarked</b> distances across the range, plus a <strong>100-Yard Long Shot Challenge</strong> at the very end. Archers will shoot 23 potential target stations, and 25 total arrows (counting mulligans).</h3>
<h3><a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/3dtargetscoring.jpeg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignright" src="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/3dtargetscoring-210x145.jpeg" alt="3D Target Scoring" width="298" height="206" /></a><span style="color: #000000;">This 3D Round includes:</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>23 3D Shooting Stations</li>
<li>Scoring is 10-8-5</li>
<li>Maximum Score is 230</li>
<li>Rangefinders are allowed</li>
</ul>
<p>We utilize a diverse selection of high-quality Rhinehart and Mackenzie targets arranged in various hunting scenarios. Only one arrow per target is permitted unless mulligans are purchased. Participants may buy up to two mulligans and two doe tags for $1 each, either online or at the visitors&#8217; table. The scoring system is 10-8-5 (see picture above). <a href="https://nfaausa.com/about/constitution/official-nfaa-rounds-part -ii" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the NFAAUSA.com Scoring Rules (Section K., NFAA 3-D Rules and Regulations).</a></p>
<p><strong><em>An arrow that strikes a branch or other object and misses the target is a miss.</em></strong></p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">About Mulligans and Doe Tags</span></h3>
<p>If you missed or scored low with the first arrow, a mulligan allows you to take another shot at a target. Your score is determined by that second (mulligan) arrow, even if it&#8217;s worse than the first.</p>
<p>There are a maximum of two buck-doe spreads in the field where the doe is placed between the buck and the archer. If you hit the doe and do not have a doe tag, you score negative five (-5) points on that target. With a doe tag, you score zero (0) points.</p>
<p class="p1"><strong><em><span class="s1">If you hit the buck or miss completely, you may use a mulligan, and your score is determined by that second arrow.</span></em></strong></p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">For Younger Shooters</span></h3>
<p>For Youths (12-14 years old), the longest distance is 40 yards. For Cubs (11 years old &#38; under), the longest distance is 25 yards.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">Registration</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Online registration</a></li>
<li>Free for children 14 and below</li>
<li>$30 for SDA members and active-duty Military ($34 with mulligans and doe tags)</li>
<li>$40 for Non-members ($44 with mulligans and doe tags)</li>
</ul>
<h3><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">• Preregister and pay today</a></h3>
<h4>3D Shoots will NOT be canceled due to bad weather!</h4>
<p>&#160;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com/morley-field-flat-ground-3d-september-12-2026/">Morley Field Flat-Ground 3D  – September 12, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com">San Diego Archers</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3 style="color: #993300;"><span style="color: #333333;">A</span> <span style="color: #000000;"><span style="color: #993300;">Flat-Ground 3D Shoot</span> will be hosted by the San Diego Archers on</span> Saturday, September 12th, 2026, <span style="color: #000000;">at the Morley Field Sports Complex Archery Range (</span><a href="https://www.accuweather.com/en/us/balboa-park/92101/daily-weather-forecast/2628152" target="_blank" rel="noopener">🌧️ AccuWeather</a><span style="color: #000000;">)</span></h3>
<h3><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw x1bwycvy x193iq5w x4fas0m x19kjcj4 alignright" src="https://scontent.fsan1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/559007392_10161975462198193_9075367682779313500_n.jpg?stp=cp6_dst-jpg_tt6&amp;cstp=mx2048x1536&amp;ctp=s2048x1536&amp;_nc_cat=102&amp;_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_ohc=A46ZBWP7r3kQ7kNvwHoQ-A-&amp;[long]&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fsan1-2.fna&amp;_nc_gid=eF4ln9lFqaEPFUEwhE8kIA&amp;_nc_ss=7b2a8&amp;[long]&amp;oe=6AA232DA" alt="No photo description available." width="533" height="400" data-visualcompletion="media-vc-image" /></h3>
<p><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-size: 18pt;">• Tournament preregistration and pay online today</span></a></p>
<h3>This event will be a Flatground 3D shoot held at the <b>Morley Field Archery Range </b>at <b>3pm</b>. Check in/Equipment Check will open at 2:30pm, and archers are encouraged to show up as early as 2pm to help set up. Walk on registrations are allowed!</h3>
<h3>There will be 2 rounds of 10 3D target stations and an iron-ring challenge placed at <b>unmarked</b> distances across the range, plus a <strong>100-Yard Long Shot Challenge</strong> at the very end. Archers will shoot 23 potential target stations, and 25 total arrows (counting mulligans).</h3>
<h3><a href="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/3dtargetscoring.jpeg"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignright" src="https://sandiegoarchers.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/3dtargetscoring-210x145.jpeg" alt="3D Target Scoring" width="298" height="206" /></a><span style="color: #000000;">This 3D Round includes:</span></h3>
<ul>
<li>23 3D Shooting Stations</li>
<li>Scoring is 10-8-5</li>
<li>Maximum Score is 230</li>
<li>Rangefinders are allowed</li>
</ul>
<p>We utilize a diverse selection of high-quality Rhinehart and Mackenzie targets arranged in various hunting scenarios. Only one arrow per target is permitted unless mulligans are purchased. Participants may buy up to two mulligans and two doe tags for $1 each, either online or at the visitors&#8217; table. The scoring system is 10-8-5 (see picture above). <a href="https://nfaausa.com/about/constitution/official-nfaa-rounds-part -ii" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Read the NFAAUSA.com Scoring Rules (Section K., NFAA 3-D Rules and Regulations).</a></p>
<p><strong><em>An arrow that strikes a branch or other object and misses the target is a miss.</em></strong></p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">About Mulligans and Doe Tags</span></h3>
<p>If you missed or scored low with the first arrow, a mulligan allows you to take another shot at a target. Your score is determined by that second (mulligan) arrow, even if it&#8217;s worse than the first.</p>
<p>There are a maximum of two buck-doe spreads in the field where the doe is placed between the buck and the archer. If you hit the doe and do not have a doe tag, you score negative five (-5) points on that target. With a doe tag, you score zero (0) points.</p>
<p class="p1"><strong><em><span class="s1">If you hit the buck or miss completely, you may use a mulligan, and your score is determined by that second arrow.</span></em></strong></p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">For Younger Shooters</span></h3>
<p>For Youths (12-14 years old), the longest distance is 40 yards. For Cubs (11 years old &amp; under), the longest distance is 25 yards.</p>
<h3><span style="color: #000000;">Registration</span></h3>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Online registration</a></li>
<li>Free for children 14 and below</li>
<li>$30 for SDA members and active-duty Military ($34 with mulligans and doe tags)</li>
<li>$40 for Non-members ($44 with mulligans and doe tags)</li>
</ul>
<h3><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdcLHZFQxLTN9fU4yXYeFJ86zmiJO0Whn2qzipbg36MY-eVyQ/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener">• Preregister and pay today</a></h3>
<h4>3D Shoots will NOT be canceled due to bad weather!</h4>
